      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 21.97802197802198,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Yesterday, I was watching the movie \n\"Moonage Daydream\" with my friend Eddy at Filmcasino.\nIt was a very inspiring documentary about\nDavid Bowie by Brett Morgen, who used a\nslightly unconventional but perfectly fitting \nform that matched the multi-faceted artist, \na self-proclaimed \"generalist\".",
      "baseline": 194,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Yesterday, I was watching the movie \n\"Moonage Daydream\" with my friend Eddy at Filmcasino.\nIt was a very inspiring documentary about\nDavid Bowie by Brett Morgen, who used a\nslightly unconventional but perfectly fitting \nform that matched the multi-faceted artist, \na self-proclaimed \"generalist\"."
    },
